<title>PHILIPPINES: Bankard 1996 unaudited net 161 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Bankard 1996 unaudited net 161 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankard Inc, one of the country's largest credit card issuers, reported an unaudited net income of 161 million pesos for 1996, the Philippine Stock Exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The net income was 29 percent more than 1995 earnings while revenues were 39 percent higher, a stock exchange statement said.</p>
<p>The company did not give exact year-ago figures.</p>
<p>Last Thursday, the Philippine Star newspaper reported that Bankard Inc posted an unaudited net income of 161 million pesos in 1996 and revenues of 952.6 million pesos.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
